# The overlay is private. Ignore the DIRECTORY, not its contents: `engine.py sync init` writes an
# allowlist .gitignore inside it, and a nested .gitignore can re-include anything a parent `overlay/*`
# rule ignored. It cannot re-include inside an ignored directory. The canon's own overlay files
# (README.md, *.template.md, mcp.template.json) are already tracked; add a new template with `git add -f`.
overlay/
inbox/*.local.md
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
